@node LIBRARIES
@prev EXAMPLE
@next AY
@toc INDEX
@{h1}Libaries

Provided with the ZNC Compiler are several libraries, some with example code.
As they are all saved in the /zdev/ directory including any of them in you own
app is as simple as

include "/zdev/<< library >>.znc"

- @{"ay.znc" LINK AY}           A sound library for the AY chips
- @{"binary.znc" LINK BINARY}       Print Binary Numbers **
- @{"datetime.znc" LINK DATETIME}     A library for fetching the day time from the RTC **
- @{"daysinmonth.vnc" LINK DAYSINMONTH}            A function to return the number of days in the month **
- @{"fexists.znc" LINK FEXISTS}       Test if a file exists
- @{"fileio.znc" LINK FILEIO}       A simple file handling library
- @{"intToMonth.znc" LINK INTTOMONTH}   Integer to month name string **
- @{"io.znc" LINK IO}           A screen control and simple keyboard handling library
- @{"joystick.znc" LINK JOYSTICK}     Reading the MDC (Mega-Drive) joystick **
- @{"memory.znc" LINK MEMORY}       Simple memory management library
- @{"mouse.znc" LINK MOUSE}        Reading the PS/2 mouse **
- @{"nextparam.vnc" LINK NEXTPARAM}      gets the next parameter **
- @{"printf.vnc" LINK PRINTF}      a simple printf function
- @{"rnd.znc" LINK RND}          Random number library
- @{"sprite.znc" LINK SPRITE}       Basic hardware sprite control
- @{"startdayofmonth.vnc" LINK STDAYMONTH}      a function to get the weekday of the first day of a  mnth **
- @{"strcontains.znc" LINK STRCONTAINS}  Does the string contain text **
- @{"string.znc" LINK STRING}       C-like strings
- @{"strtoint.vnc" LINK STRTOINT}     String to Integer **
- @{"version.znc" LINK VERSION}      Retrieve the NextOS and firmware version numbers **

** provided by Ian 'Nuntis' Jukes
   cf. https://github.com/Nuntis-Spayz/sev-znc-libs
